/target

# Wine 11.0 build + the "webview2" bottle, previously used to run the
# now-deleted browser-windows-win32/browser-windows-nwg/browser-wx crates
# under Wine. No longer used by anything in this repo (browser-windows-winui/
# browser-windows-reactor both need the real Windows App SDK runtime, which
# doesn't work under Wine at all) - kept ignored in case a multi-GB `.wine/`
# still exists on disk from before that deletion; safe to `rm -rf .wine` to
# reclaim the space.
/.wine

# Zig toolchain used by `cargo zigbuild` to cross-compile
# browser-macos-appkit from Linux (see README.md's "browser-macos-appkit:
# building" section) - a large, machine-specific binary artifact, not
# project source.
/.zig

# macOS SDK (framework .tbd stubs etc.) used by `cargo zigbuild` to
# cross-compile browser-macos-appkit from Linux (see README.md's
# "browser-macos-appkit: building" section) - a large (~1.5GB), unofficial
# mirror of Apple SDK content, not project source. See that section for
# provenance/licensing notes before assuming this is redistributable.
/.macos-sdk
